@startuml adoption-state
!pragma layout smetana
title VetClinic – Adoption Listing States

hide empty description

[*] --> DRAFT : vet creates listing

DRAFT --> ACTIVE : publish()
ACTIVE --> RESERVED : reserve()\n(interview, optional)
RESERVED --> ACTIVE : release()\n(interview negative)
ACTIVE --> ADOPTED : complete()\n(application approved)
RESERVED --> ADOPTED : complete()\n(application approved)
ACTIVE --> CLOSED : close()
RESERVED --> CLOSED : close()
CLOSED --> DRAFT : reopen()

ADOPTED --> [*]

ACTIVE : acceptsApplications() = true
DRAFT : not public
RESERVED : public, "interview in progress" badge
ADOPTED : public, "found a home" page
CLOSED : not public

note as invalid
  **Invalid transitions** (throw IllegalStateTransitionException):
  - ADOPTED -> any state (final)
  - DRAFT -> RESERVED, ADOPTED, CLOSED
  - ACTIVE -> DRAFT (no reopen; close first)
  - RESERVED -> DRAFT, RESERVED (no second reserve)
  - CLOSED -> ACTIVE, RESERVED, ADOPTED (must reopen to DRAFT first)
  - publish() on anything but DRAFT; reopen() on anything but CLOSED
  Only ACTIVE accepts new applications.
end note

@enduml
